  "description_html": "Skeletal diagram of <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yingshanosaurus\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Yingshanosaurus\">Yingshanosaurus jichuanensis</a></i> showing known fossil material of the holotype (<b>CV00722</b>) specimen. Scale bar=1 m.\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Key\">Key</h3></div>\n<p><b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#FFFFFF\" title=\"#FFFFFF\"> </b>=Holotype <small style=\"font-size:85%;\">(CV00722)</small><br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#BCB8B7\" title=\"#BCB8B7\"> </b>=Unfigured elements present in the holotype<br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#8C8C8C\" title=\"#8C8C8C\"> </b>=Unknown\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"References\">References</h3></div>\n<ul><li>\"记四川盆地营山县一剑龙化石 [Record of a fossil stegosaur from Yingshan in the Sichuan Basin]\"</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1755-6724.2007.tb00959.x\">\"The First Stegosaur (Dinosauria, Ornithischia) from the Upper Jurassic Shishugou Formation of Xinjiang, China\"</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/272151997_Skeleton_of_the_stegosaurian_dinosaur_Lexovisaurus_from_the_lower_part_of_the_Middle_Callovian_Middle_Jurassic_of_Argences_Calvados_Normandy\">\"Skeleton of the stegosaurian dinosaur <i>Lexovisaurus</i> from the lower part of the Middle Callovian (Middle Jurassic) of Argences (Calvados), Normandy\"</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/randomdinos/art/Hesperosaurus-mjosi-skeletal-reconstruction-966450900\"><i>Hesperosaurus</i> skeletal</a> by Henrique Paes</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.skeletaldrawing.com/ornithiscians/kentrosaurus\"><i>Kentrosaurus</i> skeletal</a> by Scott Hartman</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0138352\">\"The Postcranial Skeleton of an Exceptionally Complete Individual of the Plated Dinosaur <i>Stegosaurus stenops</i> (Dinosauria: Thyreophora) from the Upper Jurassic Morrison Formation of Wyoming, U.S.A.\"</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/sketchy-raptor/art/Say-some-Stegosaurus-stenops-skeletons-sir-884386195\"><i>Stegosaurus stenops</i> skeletals</a> by Matt Dempsey</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://dx.doi.org/10.4202/app.2009.1105\" href=\"https://dx.doi.org/10.4202/app.2009.1105\">\"Evidence for a sauropod-like metacarpal configuration in stegosaurian dinosaurs\"</a></li></ul>",
